== diags.diag/for-unique-item
BYN2022 11:16 a `for` over the unique `Item` `List<i64>` of `Rows` is not supported in v0.1
  help make `Rows.Item` a value that is not unique, such as an index, and look the item up in the loop
BYN6005 6:15 `get` uses `alloc`, beyond the bound `pure` declared by `IIndexable.get`
  label uses `alloc`
  help declare `alloc` on `IIndexable.get`, or pass a function without it
